{"3766630": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "OCULUM", "steam_appid": 3766630, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "controller_support": "full", "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3766630/extras/ede65efbe0c4a3e79cbf27e7f28712b1.poster.avif?t=1788112299\" aria-label=\"The player jumps through platforms. They perform jumps, do a front flip, and dashes forward to make it to the next platforms.\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3766630/extras/ede65efbe0c4a3e79cbf27e7f28712b1.webm?t=1788112299\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3766630/extras/ede65efbe0c4a3e79cbf27e7f28712b1.mp4?t=1788112299\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span>  </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3766630/extras/c2a88de2fbba1570bef82227c36a2ccb.avif?t=1788112299\" alt=\"Endure\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3766630/extras_big/c2a88de2fbba1570bef82227c36a2ccb.webp?t=1788112299 width=1560 height=267 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You wake up in an unfamiliar world. Who are you; how does this place exist, and who are THEY? Every jump is an invitation to the bottom, and every leap brings you closer to the truth. Why are we here?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3766630/extras/965c6b53df043882cb1aa3d101cefec4.poster.avif?t=1788112299\" aria-label=\"The player is jumping into an eye which explodes and grants the player a currency point.\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3766630/extras/965c6b53df043882cb1aa3d101cefec4.webm?t=1788112299\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3766630/extras/965c6b53df043882cb1aa3d101cefec4.mp4?t=1788112299\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3766630/extras/7db19856a88e3565b1564be23616c357.avif?t=1788112299\" alt=\"The Climb\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3766630/extras_big/7db19856a88e3565b1564be23616c357.webp?t=1788112299 width=1560 height=267 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Throughout OCULUM, you will gain new abilities and further your understanding of the game's mechanics and theme. You will fail, and you will fall. But how you pick yourself up from that inevitability will come to shape the rest of your story. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3766630/extras/db09a1c880c812824ba557d4c8989533.poster.avif?t=1788112299\" aria-label=\"A wall with a giant eye is visible, and the eye blinks once.\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3766630/extras/db09a1c880c812824ba557d4c8989533.webm?t=1788112299\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3766630/extras/db09a1c880c812824ba557d4c8989533.mp4?t=1788112299\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3766630/extras/4335071a58ff79e3d0157ae11fdad261.avif?t=1788112299\" alt=\"Survive\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3766630/extras_big/4335071a58ff79e3d0157ae11fdad261.webp?t=1788112299 width=1560 height=267 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The world of OCULUM is brutal. Your in-game camera is directly attached to the player character's body, so every flip and fall will feel nauseating and will take some time to get used to. Feel how you're adapting to the challenges, and how you improve between falls. There are many ways to reach the top. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3766630/extras/68f62e37c6b8dd7ec1e1f87fabcb0bfd.poster.avif?t=1788112299\" aria-label=\"The player falls down a hole. A lot of platforms and scenery is passing by quickly.\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3766630/extras/68f62e37c6b8dd7ec1e1f87fabcb0bfd.webm?t=1788112299\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3766630/extras/68f62e37c6b8dd7ec1e1f87fabcb0bfd.mp4?t=1788112299\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3766630/extras/db174b8362e2082c811c39cde9c3d1d0.avif?t=1788112299\" alt=\"The Fall\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3766630/extras_big/db174b8362e2082c811c39cde9c3d1d0.webp?t=1788112299 width=1560 height=267 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This game is not for the weak of heart. Will you join the fold down at the bottom, or do you have what it takes to rise above the rest?</p>", "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3766630/extras/ede65efbe0c4a3e79cbf27e7f28712b1.poster.avif?t=1788112299\" aria-label=\"The player jumps through platforms. They perform jumps, do a front flip, and dashes forward to make it to the next platforms.\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3766630/extras/ede65efbe0c4a3e79cbf27e7f28712b1.webm?t=1788112299\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3766630/extras/ede65efbe0c4a3e79cbf27e7f28712b1.mp4?t=1788112299\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span>  </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3766630/extras/c2a88de2fbba1570bef82227c36a2ccb.avif?t=1788112299\" alt=\"Endure\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3766630/extras_big/c2a88de2fbba1570bef82227c36a2ccb.webp?t=1788112299 width=1560 height=267 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You wake up in an unfamiliar world. Who are you; how does this place exist, and who are THEY? Every jump is an invitation to the bottom, and every leap brings you closer to the truth. Why are we here?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3766630/extras/965c6b53df043882cb1aa3d101cefec4.poster.avif?t=1788112299\" aria-label=\"The player is jumping into an eye which explodes and grants the player a currency point.\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3766630/extras/965c6b53df043882cb1aa3d101cefec4.webm?t=1788112299\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3766630/extras/965c6b53df043882cb1aa3d101cefec4.mp4?t=1788112299\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3766630/extras/7db19856a88e3565b1564be23616c357.avif?t=1788112299\" alt=\"The Climb\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3766630/extras_big/7db19856a88e3565b1564be23616c357.webp?t=1788112299 width=1560 height=267 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Throughout OCULUM, you will gain new abilities and further your understanding of the game's mechanics and theme. You will fail, and you will fall. But how you pick yourself up from that inevitability will come to shape the rest of your story. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3766630/extras/db09a1c880c812824ba557d4c8989533.poster.avif?t=1788112299\" aria-label=\"A wall with a giant eye is visible, and the eye blinks once.\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3766630/extras/db09a1c880c812824ba557d4c8989533.webm?t=1788112299\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3766630/extras/db09a1c880c812824ba557d4c8989533.mp4?t=1788112299\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3766630/extras/4335071a58ff79e3d0157ae11fdad261.avif?t=1788112299\" alt=\"Survive\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3766630/extras_big/4335071a58ff79e3d0157ae11fdad261.webp?t=1788112299 width=1560 height=267 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The world of OCULUM is brutal. Your in-game camera is directly attached to the player character's body, so every flip and fall will feel nauseating and will take some time to get used to. Feel how you're adapting to the challenges, and how you improve between falls. There are many ways to reach the top. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3766630/extras/68f62e37c6b8dd7ec1e1f87fabcb0bfd.poster.avif?t=1788112299\" aria-label=\"The player falls down a hole. A lot of platforms and scenery is passing by quickly.\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3766630/extras/68f62e37c6b8dd7ec1e1f87fabcb0bfd.webm?t=1788112299\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3766630/extras/68f62e37c6b8dd7ec1e1f87fabcb0bfd.mp4?t=1788112299\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3766630/extras/db174b8362e2082c811c39cde9c3d1d0.avif?t=1788112299\" alt=\"The Fall\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3766630/extras_big/db174b8362e2082c811c39cde9c3d1d0.webp?t=1788112299 width=1560 height=267 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This game is not for the weak of heart. Will you join the fold down at the bottom, or do you have what it takes to rise above the rest?</p>", "short_description": "OCULUM is a challenging first-person platformer set within a strange and unsettling world. Every step is a gamble, and every mistake is brutal. Climb toward the summit, uncover its secrets, and face whatever is waiting above. Will you endure?", "supported_languages": "English<strong>*</strong><br><strong>*</strong>languages with full audio support", "header_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3766630/1f0b6f8fc86c205fd531d9b71cd0b6cf6f4d8273/header.jpg?t=1788112299", "capsule_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3766630/f5da90f0636110ea6677e0bdffea658700155ce4/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1788112299", "capsule_imagev5": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3766630/f5da90f0636110ea6677e0bdffea658700155ce4/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1788112299", "website": "https://www.tomastic.com/", "pc_requirements": {"minimum": "<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>OS:</strong> 11<br></li><li><strong>Processor:</strong> i5 4670K<br></li><li><strong>Memory:</strong> 8 GB RAM<br></li><li><strong>Graphics:</strong> NVIDIA GTX 1050<br></li><li><strong>DirectX:</strong> Version 11<br></li><li><strong>Storage:</strong> 5 GB available space</li></ul>", "recommended": "<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>OS:</strong> 11<br></li><li><strong>Processor:</strong> i7 4770K<br></li><li><strong>Memory:</strong> 16 GB RAM<br></li><li><strong>Graphics:</strong> NVIDIA RTX 2060<br></li><li><strong>DirectX:</strong> Version 11<br></li><li><strong>Storage:</strong> 10 GB available space</li></ul>"}, "mac_requirements": [], "linux_requirements": {"minimum": "<strong>Minimum:</strong><b